{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14804","headline":"酬赵少尹戏示诸侄元阳等因以见赠 · 卢纶","name":"酬赵少尹戏示诸侄元阳等因以见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八龙三虎俨成行，琼树花开鹤翼张。\n且请同观舞鸜鹆，何须竟哂食槟榔。\n归时每爱怀朱橘，戏处常闻佩紫囊。\n谬入阮家逢庆乐，竹林因得奉壶觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}